WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:17.993 --> 00:00:20.896
"Kissing at High Tide"

2
00:00:23.321 --> 00:00:25.456
When I used to laugh

3
00:00:25.456 --> 00:00:27.256
I can feel a sense of distance

4
00:00:28.296 --> 00:00:31.319
There is a layer of fog in the smile

5
00:00:32.370 --> 00:00:33.585
But

6
00:00:34.056 --> 00:00:35.378
It's different now

7
00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:39.046
Brother can really laugh happily

8
00:00:39.865 --> 00:00:40.703
and warm

9
00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:42.538
And sincere

10
00:00:43.933 --> 00:00:45.052
that moment

11
00:00:45.725 --> 00:00:47.530
my heart

12
00:00:47.530 --> 00:00:49.155
Fall all of a sudden

13
00:00:50.208 --> 00:00:50.983
Brother

14
00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:52.972
do you know

15
00:00:54.250 --> 00:00:56.293
your smile

16
00:00:56.293 --> 00:00:58.184
More dazzling than anything else

17
00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:00.185
that smile

18
00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:03.940
can really make me

19
00:01:03.940 --> 00:01:05.765
into your heart

20
00:01:25.075 --> 00:01:26.803
when you read a book

21
00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:29.869
What I like best is standing next to you and cooking for you

22
00:01:30.985 --> 00:01:32.569
That kind of ordinary moment

23
00:01:33.431 --> 00:01:35.178
But in my world

24
00:01:35.178 --> 00:01:37.049
the most real happiness

25
00:01:38.622 --> 00:01:41.318
Just like this heat

26
00:01:41.318 --> 00:01:42.588
my heart

27
00:01:43.375 --> 00:01:46.100
Also quietly surrounding you

28
00:01:47.386 --> 00:01:49.346
I'm making a fuss

29
00:01:49.346 --> 00:01:51.789
when you laugh again and again

30
00:01:52.993 --> 00:01:55.252
Just you love me

31
00:01:55.795 --> 00:01:59.344
It's also proof that I love you

32
00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:23.668
what are you doing

33
00:02:48.984 --> 00:02:50.225
you

34
00:02:50.225 --> 00:02:52.359
Are you a little dissatisfied with me recently?

35
00:02:52.359 --> 00:02:55.133
Then do it yourself, Chef-sama

36
00:03:04.162 --> 00:03:06.178
I don't want to eat it myself

37
00:03:06.178 --> 00:03:07.658
You should try it too

38
00:03:36.875 --> 00:03:38.137
How is it

39
00:03:38.137 --> 00:03:39.572
What does it taste like this time?

40
00:03:41.403 --> 00:03:42.809
sweet

41
00:03:43.835 --> 00:03:45.561
Everything I give you is sweet.

42
00:03:58.722 --> 00:04:00.082
That's weird

43
00:04:12.949 --> 00:04:15.258
What are you doing? It's so cold.

44
00:04:31.275 --> 00:04:34.725
The moment I saw you put on Ruby's apron

45
00:04:34.725 --> 00:04:36.565
I just understand

46
00:04:37.346 --> 00:04:39.434
Even the coldest person

47
00:04:40.202 --> 00:04:43.697
I will slowly melt for one person

48
00:04:44.759 --> 00:04:47.159
And that person

49
00:04:47.159 --> 00:04:48.803
it's me

50
00:06:00.777 --> 00:06:01.943
what is this

51
00:06:03.136 --> 00:06:05.175
Critical illness notification letter sent from the hospital

52
00:06:06.844 --> 00:06:08.101
piece of paper

53
00:06:09.266 --> 00:06:11.416
Why does it hurt so much

54
00:06:14.832 --> 00:06:16.328
Dr. David

55
00:06:17.114 --> 00:06:18.605
Now I want to book a ward

56
00:06:18.605 --> 00:06:20.529
Right now

57
00:06:20.875 --> 00:06:22.718
To VIP-1

58
00:06:22.718 --> 00:06:25.294
I personally guarantee

59
00:06:41.462 --> 00:06:43.314
why

60
00:06:44.369 --> 00:06:46.047
You want to help me like this

61
00:06:55.104 --> 00:06:56.819
because i want to

62
00:07:00.965 --> 00:07:02.692
what i want is

63
00:07:03.661 --> 00:07:05.324
when you want to cry

64
00:07:06.877 --> 00:07:09.408
The first person that comes to mind is me

65
00:07:26.568 --> 00:07:27.424
Brother

66
00:07:28.871 --> 00:07:31.161
There is something I really want to say to you

67
00:07:32.472 --> 00:07:34.853
Can I really rely on you?

68
00:07:36.600 --> 00:07:37.668
me

69
00:07:38.965 --> 00:07:40.965
Not that strong actually

70
00:07:42.137 --> 00:07:43.799
Still a little unfamiliar

71
00:07:45.657 --> 00:07:47.891
It always makes you angry

72
00:07:49.178 --> 00:07:50.228
But

73
00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:52.989
Brother

74
00:07:52.989 --> 00:07:54.989
you are always by my side

75
00:07:56.231 --> 00:07:58.412
I am used to being alone

76
00:07:59.829 --> 00:08:01.829
Now I always want to rely on you

77
00:08:03.364 --> 00:08:04.292
Brother

78
00:08:06.457 --> 00:08:08.457
Is this really okay?

79
00:08:09.860 --> 00:08:10.728
me

80
00:08:12.245 --> 00:08:14.788
Can I really rely on you completely?

81
00:08:54.315 --> 00:08:55.471
Haijun

82
00:08:56.168 --> 00:08:57.434
look at me

83
00:08:57.434 --> 00:08:59.275
It'll be fine

84
00:08:59.275 --> 00:09:00.934
I will definitely protect you

85
00:09:00.934 --> 00:09:03.097
all the things you care about

86
00:09:04.175 --> 00:09:05.781
Mom will be fine

87
00:09:05.781 --> 00:09:07.065
It will be safe for sure

88
00:09:07.695 --> 00:09:10.085
This is not comfort, this is a promise

89
00:09:10.775 --> 00:09:12.675
So don't cry alone anymore

90
00:09:12.675 --> 00:09:13.706
don't be sad anymore

91
00:09:13.706 --> 00:09:16.272
From now on, your business is my business

92
00:09:17.471 --> 00:09:19.890
Protect your smile

93
00:09:19.890 --> 00:09:21.888
That's why I live

94
00:09:22.925 --> 00:09:26.568
So please put you and your future

95
00:09:26.568 --> 00:09:28.405
Leave it to me

96
00:09:57.159 --> 00:09:58.639
I'm willing to do anything for you

97
